<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Agatti Island to Mangalore Car Transport Cost &amp; Shipping Guide
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for shipping a car from Agatti to Mangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The complete journey usually takes 12‑16 days, including island clearance, sea freight on a dedicated cargo vessel, port handling at New Mangalore, and inland container delivery. Weather conditions, vessel schedules, and customs processing can cause minor variations, but Shree Ashirwad Packers aims to meet the promised timeline.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there size or weight limits for vehicles on the Agatti‑Mangalore route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Standard passenger cars up to 2.5 tons and dimensions not exceeding 4.5 m length, 2.0 m width, and 1.8 m height are accepted without special arrangements. Larger SUVs, trucks, or luxury cars may require custom crating and additional freight charges, which are reflected in the tariff matrix.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure the safety of my car during sea and road transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The company uses a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system, hydraulic loading ramps, high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and GPS‑enabled containers. Each vehicle is inspected, secured with wheel chocks, and covered with weather‑proof stretch film. Real‑time tracking lets customers monitor the journey, and a 100 % declared‑value insurance backs every shipment.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it moves from Agatti to Mangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Shree Ashirwad provides satellite‑based GPS tracking for every container. Customers receive a secure link to view live location updates, estimated arrival times, and status alerts at each transit milestone—from island loading to final delivery at the mainland doorstep.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included in the Agatti to Mangalore car transport cost?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The quoted cost includes IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % of the declared vehicle value against loss, theft, and accidental damage during sea and road phases. Optional extended coverage can be added for higher valuation or specific risk concerns, with transparent premium rates disclosed upfront.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How should I prepare my car before it is loaded onto the cargo vessel from Agatti?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Prepare by removing personal belongings, disabling alarms, ensuring a quarter‑tank of fuel, checking for fluid leaks, and documenting existing scratches with photos. Disable any aftermarket accessories, secure loose parts, and provide a valid registration and insurance copy. Following these steps speeds up clearance and protects the vehicle during handling.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
